  "Are you a senior developer?",
  "How can you prove you are a senior developer?",
  "Do you are senior developer?",
  "Who are you?",
  "What can you do for IVX Holdings?",
  "What were we discussing before?",
  "Tell me more.",
  "Continue.",
  "What do you recommend?",
  "Are you sure?",
  "Explain that simply.",
  "What is the next step?",
  "Is this good?",
  "What is broken?",
  "Can you remember this?",
  "Why did you answer that?",
  "Quién eres tú?",
  "Qué puedes hacer?",
  "Dime más.",
  "Continúa.",
];

